COMMENT     ORF only: drops between the backbone's existing UTR
            rails. The construct's own UTRs are NOT part of this
            order, so the backbone's UTRs are what the transcript
            will carry.
COMMENT     Left overlap ends in the Kozak (GCCACC), so the fragment
            starts at ATG and must not repeat it.
